WEBVTT

00:00:00.520 --> 00:00:03.600
I'm definitely gonna be the first-star idol!

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:07.610
Nijino Yume's about to start her Aikatsu!

00:00:09.820 --> 00:00:12.030
So far on Aikatsu Stars!

00:00:12.030 --> 00:00:17.450
I'm a second-year exchange student at the idol middle school, Venus Ark.

00:00:17.450 --> 00:00:21.500
I'm keeping at my Aikatsu hard every day of summer break.

00:00:22.870 --> 00:00:24.460
It's been a busy summer. {you just said it was summer vacation.}

00:00:24.460 --> 00:00:29.550
We all participated in Yuzu-senpai's treasure hunt event.

00:00:29.550 --> 00:00:34.050
At the very end, we found Hime-senpai and the others all together!

00:00:35.930 --> 00:00:39.600
After that, we celebrated another year of Aikatsu Island.

00:00:39.600 --> 00:00:45.520
I had so many wonderful encounters on that tropical island that I still can't contain my excitement!

00:00:46.310 --> 00:00:49.570
Nijino Yume—ready to kick my Aikatsu up another notch!

00:00:53.490 --> 00:00:56.610
Elza-sama, what is it you wanted to discuss?

00:00:57.450 --> 00:01:01.160
Tomorrow, Venus Ark will depart from Japan

00:01:01.160 --> 00:01:04.830
to go on a Live Tour Cruise across the Pacific Ocean.

00:01:06.040 --> 00:01:08.920
We will not return to Japan for a while.

00:01:08.920 --> 00:01:13.130
<i>I was finally reunited with Yume-chan and my friends again, but now...</i>

00:01:14.050 --> 00:01:15.340
Koharu Nanakura!

00:01:15.340 --> 00:01:16.550
Ah, yes!

00:01:16.550 --> 00:01:20.680
Before we go, you will disembark from this ship.

00:01:20.680 --> 00:01:21.810
Huh?

00:01:21.810 --> 00:01:25.640
However, this is not an expulsion, but your graduation.

00:01:26.980 --> 00:01:30.440
Your talent as a designer is irrefutable.

00:01:30.440 --> 00:01:35.280
Even by Venus Ark's standards, 
you have developed top-level skills.

00:01:35.280 --> 00:01:37.570
What you do with those abilities...

00:01:37.990 --> 00:01:40.450
...is entirely up to you.

00:01:40.450 --> 00:01:42.330
Up to me...

00:01:45.460 --> 00:01:48.000
Thank you very much, Elza-sama.

00:03:29.350 --> 00:03:31.230
Yume! Wake up!

00:03:33.980 --> 00:03:35.310
Is she up?

00:03:35.310 --> 00:03:37.280
No, she's still asleep.

00:03:38.400 --> 00:03:40.610
What do you want so early?

00:03:40.610 --> 00:03:41.150
Yes!

00:03:41.150 --> 00:03:41.400
Go!

00:03:41.400 --> 00:03:41.860
Yes!

00:03:41.860 --> 00:03:42.200
Go!

00:03:42.200 --> 00:03:42.570
Yes!

00:03:42.570 --> 00:03:42.860
Go!

00:03:42.860 --> 00:03:43.320
Yes!

00:03:43.320 --> 00:03:43.610
Go!

00:03:43.610 --> 00:03:43.990
Yes!

00:03:43.990 --> 00:03:44.320
Go!

00:03:44.320 --> 00:03:44.700
Yes!

00:03:44.700 --> 00:03:44.990
Go!

00:03:45.580 --> 00:03:47.990
Huh? What's their hurry?

00:03:47.990 --> 00:03:49.290
It's an emergency!

00:03:51.160 --> 00:03:53.790
You have my deepest apologies.

00:03:53.790 --> 00:03:57.170
That's fine and all, but aren't you setting sail way too suddenly?

00:03:57.170 --> 00:03:59.760
It is by Elza-sama's orders.

00:03:59.760 --> 00:04:02.300
What are we exchange students supposed to do?

00:04:02.300 --> 00:04:07.560
It simply means the end of your temporary exchange and that you will depart immediately.

00:04:07.890 --> 00:04:11.060
We have already contacted Four Star Academy.

00:04:11.060 --> 00:04:15.310
Don't you think pushing this forward so one-sidedly is kind of unreasonable? {unfair to us}

00:04:15.310 --> 00:04:19.190
I would prefer if we could hear the reasoning straight from Elza-san. {you almost fucked me there}

00:04:19.190 --> 00:04:23.610
I'm afraid her hands are full preparing the tour schedule.

00:04:23.610 --> 00:04:26.200
She has barred all visitors from her room.

00:04:26.200 --> 00:04:27.990
I shouldn't be surprised.

00:04:27.990 --> 00:04:28.950
But...

00:04:30.120 --> 00:04:35.330
We were only here on exchange, but Koharu-chan is an actual student at Venus Ark...

00:04:35.330 --> 00:04:38.540
Th-That's right! Does that mean we're going to be separated again?

00:04:38.540 --> 00:04:40.340
I won't accept it!

00:04:40.340 --> 00:04:43.170
Oh, if you're concerned about Nanakura-sama—

00:04:43.170 --> 00:04:45.300
We've gotta go talk to Koharu-chan!

00:04:45.840 --> 00:04:48.470
Right, it's worth trying to convince her otherwise.

00:04:48.470 --> 00:04:49.220
Let's go!

00:04:49.220 --> 00:04:50.060
Okay!

00:04:51.430 --> 00:04:54.600
No, actually, Nanakura-sama is...

00:04:56.850 --> 00:04:59.230
That's a rather packed schedule.

00:04:59.230 --> 00:05:01.690
Just who do you believe I am?

00:05:01.690 --> 00:05:03.990
That goes without saying—Perfect Elza.

00:05:03.990 --> 00:05:09.240
Exactly. No matter the schedule, I will complete it perfectly.{she will abide by archaic made-up syntactical rules}{perfect area complete}

00:05:09.240 --> 00:05:13.790
Though I wonder if the same can be said of the Star Premium Rare Coords.

00:05:13.790 --> 00:05:16.960
I will have the last laugh.

00:05:16.960 --> 00:05:19.500
The Sun Dress will be mine alone.

00:05:20.500 --> 00:05:23.880
At the center of everything lies the sun.

00:05:23.880 --> 00:05:28.640
Every other planet needs simply to revolve around me. {I like mine}

00:05:28.640 --> 00:05:33.640
The Sun Dress holds the power to rule over everything.

00:05:33.640 --> 00:05:35.270
It's quite intriguing.

00:05:35.690 --> 00:05:38.520
It is the same with the Aikatsu Ranking.

00:05:38.520 --> 00:05:45.240
With this tour, I will once again create an insurmountable gap and become the center of the world. {Kokoneeeeeeeeee}

00:05:45.780 --> 00:05:48.030
Any luck? Was she in her room?

00:05:48.030 --> 00:05:50.370
No. It was locked too.

00:05:50.370 --> 00:05:52.450
Anyway, we just have to keep looking!

00:05:52.450 --> 00:05:53.160
Right!

00:05:54.120 --> 00:05:56.540
<i>Koharu-chan, where are you?</i>

00:05:56.540 --> 00:05:57.870
<i>Where have you gone?</i>

00:06:00.130 --> 00:06:02.550
I can't see where I'm going...

00:06:02.550 --> 00:06:05.920
Koharu-chan! Hurry up!

00:06:05.920 --> 00:06:12.010
I don't know when I'll be back in Japan, 
so I've gotta buy all the stuff I want now.

00:06:13.680 --> 00:06:15.180
You're not done yet?

00:06:15.180 --> 00:06:22.440
Well let's see, I still have to buy some games at the toy store, then stop by the CD shop...

00:06:22.440 --> 00:06:24.940
Are you sure you'll make it back before departure?

00:06:24.940 --> 00:06:28.950
Don't you worry! And thanks for coming shopping with me.

00:06:28.950 --> 00:06:33.580
They took care of my luggage for me, so it's fine.

00:06:33.580 --> 00:06:35.830
Now then, off we go!

00:06:36.950 --> 00:06:39.670
Huh? H-Hey, hold on! Wait up!

00:06:39.670 --> 00:06:41.960
I still can't see where I'm going!

00:06:43.380 --> 00:06:44.460
Koharu-chan!

00:06:47.760 --> 00:06:50.220
Oh, Nijino-san.

00:06:50.220 --> 00:06:52.850
Juli-san! Hey, um...

00:06:52.850 --> 00:06:58.850
I heard the news. It's sad to see you go after we all became friends.

00:06:58.850 --> 00:07:01.940
Yes, it came out of nowhere...

00:07:01.940 --> 00:07:06.360
I agree. Plus, we're all busy getting ready to set off.

00:07:07.030 --> 00:07:08.990
That's the thing. Juli-san—

00:07:08.990 --> 00:07:11.200
Yes, I understand.

00:07:15.530 --> 00:07:16.870
Take care.

00:07:16.870 --> 00:07:17.750
Huh?

00:07:18.290 --> 00:07:20.370
Wait, um...

00:07:20.370 --> 00:07:23.830
Have faith. I'm sure we'll meet again.

00:07:23.830 --> 00:07:26.380
Well then, congratulation!

00:07:27.340 --> 00:07:29.340
Where's Koharu-chan...

00:07:31.220 --> 00:07:33.300
She's not here either.

00:07:33.300 --> 00:07:36.850
She must not want us to see her crying.

00:07:36.850 --> 00:07:40.810
Yeah, and this is the second time we're being separated. {hasn't happened yet}

00:07:42.600 --> 00:07:44.810
There's no time until departure!

00:07:46.070 --> 00:07:46.900
The whistle!

00:07:46.900 --> 00:07:48.110
It's about to leave!

00:07:53.490 --> 00:07:56.620
I think this is just about everything I wanted.

00:07:56.620 --> 00:07:59.120
But how are you going to carry it all?

00:07:59.120 --> 00:08:03.620
No problem! Japan's got awesome delivery service!

00:08:03.620 --> 00:08:05.420
Delivery service?

00:08:20.470 --> 00:08:22.940
We never found her.

00:08:22.940 --> 00:08:23.730
Yeah...

00:08:29.820 --> 00:08:33.360
Koharu-chan!

00:08:33.360 --> 00:08:37.160
I never dreamed we'd have to part with Koharu a second time...

00:08:39.830 --> 00:08:41.250
Koharu-chan...

00:08:47.630 --> 00:08:49.590
Thank you for your patience!

00:08:49.590 --> 00:08:51.960
Hup! Hup! Hup! Hup! Hup!

00:08:53.970 --> 00:08:55.840
Delivery for you.

00:08:55.840 --> 00:08:58.100
Please sign here.

00:09:02.270 --> 00:09:04.190
Thank you very much!

00:09:06.770 --> 00:09:07.810
What?

00:09:07.810 --> 00:09:09.360
No idea.

00:09:12.940 --> 00:09:15.200
Don't tell me it's for the ship!

00:09:15.200 --> 00:09:18.620
What?! But Venus Ark already left!

00:09:18.620 --> 00:09:20.280
Should we open it?

00:09:21.910 --> 00:09:25.000
I came for your call! Baa baa baa baa!{I'll just trust your judgement on this}{it was in the CCs, I couldn't understand a word}

00:09:26.500 --> 00:09:30.540
Elza-sama! Surprise!

00:09:30.540 --> 00:09:34.510
Huh? What? I'm not on the ship?

00:09:39.890 --> 00:09:42.010
They cast off!

00:09:44.640 --> 00:09:49.150
Wait, wait! Don't go!

00:09:50.520 --> 00:09:52.110
That was hot!

00:09:52.110 --> 00:09:53.480
Koharu-chan?

00:09:53.480 --> 00:09:55.240
Yume-chan?

00:09:55.240 --> 00:09:57.660
Did you miss the ship too?

00:09:57.660 --> 00:09:59.450
Huh? Of course not.

00:09:59.450 --> 00:10:03.200
Elza-sama said that I graduated.

00:10:03.200 --> 00:10:05.200
Graduated?

00:10:05.200 --> 00:10:10.880
So, guess what? I've decided to return to Four Star Academy!

00:10:14.630 --> 00:10:16.170
I'm glad...

00:10:17.340 --> 00:10:19.470
I'm so glad!

00:10:21.350 --> 00:10:23.510
You're squeezing me too tight, Yume-chan.

00:10:22.180 --> 00:10:23.510
Koharu-chan!

00:10:24.220 --> 00:10:26.480
Thank goodness.

00:10:25.060 --> 00:10:29.230
I'm so happy... I really am...

00:10:26.480 --> 00:10:30.600
Popping right out of a box is just like our grab bag Koharu. {I sword I had a more original and clever thing than this, but I guess not, unless you can remember}{>axing me to remember things}{do I need to call Ichigo? wait...}

00:10:30.600 --> 00:10:32.230
That gets me going!

00:10:32.230 --> 00:10:34.730
<i>I</i> need to get going!

00:10:39.950 --> 00:10:42.660
Farewell for now, Japan.

00:10:42.660 --> 00:10:46.450
Are you really sure about letting Koharu go?

00:10:46.450 --> 00:10:51.000
You even personally approved of her genius as a designer.

00:10:51.000 --> 00:10:52.290
That's precisely why.

00:10:54.250 --> 00:10:55.670
I see.

00:10:55.670 --> 00:10:58.590
Come, let us have lunch.

00:10:58.590 --> 00:11:05.430
In remembrance of our time in Japan, I have prepared beef from each of the forty-seven prefectures.

00:11:05.430 --> 00:11:07.180
Splendid.

00:11:07.180 --> 00:11:10.560
Come to think of it, what happened to Kirara?

00:11:11.520 --> 00:11:13.310
Now that you mention it...

00:11:13.730 --> 00:11:15.940
Elza-sama!

00:11:15.940 --> 00:11:18.940
Come back!

00:11:31.210 --> 00:11:32.710
I'm so relieved.

00:11:33.080 --> 00:11:35.710
I was at the end of my line there.

00:11:35.710 --> 00:11:38.880
You were on the verge of tears the entire time.

00:11:38.880 --> 00:11:42.090
Th-That's not... totally wrong.{isn't this a line from hacha}{hey, you remembered Hime!}

00:11:42.090 --> 00:11:47.100
I'm sorry. I thought you already knew, 
so I was spending time with Kirara-chan.

00:11:47.100 --> 00:11:49.020
Speaking of Kirara...

00:11:55.230 --> 00:11:56.610
What should we do?

00:11:56.610 --> 00:12:01.700
She should be fine. She can just take a plane and meet Venus Ark at their next stop.

00:12:01.700 --> 00:12:03.240
I guess so.

00:12:06.950 --> 00:12:08.620
We're finally back!

00:12:11.410 --> 00:12:13.330
Here we go!

00:12:15.040 --> 00:12:17.460
Welcome back!

00:12:20.550 --> 00:12:25.010
Congratulations on your return to Four Star Academy!

00:12:25.010 --> 00:12:28.640
As a famous English poet once said:

00:12:28.640 --> 00:12:34.560
"And the end of all our exploring will be to arrive where we started

00:12:34.560 --> 00:12:38.150
and know the place for the first time." {TS Eliot's Little Gidding}

00:12:38.150 --> 00:12:42.150
Yep, yep! I don't really get it, but that's a nice line.

00:12:43.900 --> 00:12:45.110
Everyone...

00:12:45.660 --> 00:12:47.280
Nanakura Koharu!

00:12:47.280 --> 00:12:48.830
Y-Yes!

00:12:48.830 --> 00:12:51.870
You parents have already contacted me.

00:12:52.290 --> 00:12:54.210
Isn't this great, Koharu-chan?

00:12:54.210 --> 00:12:55.120
Yeah.

00:12:55.120 --> 00:12:56.040
But!

00:12:56.920 --> 00:13:00.420
What matters most is your own will.

00:13:02.510 --> 00:13:07.680
Nanakura Koharu hereby requests to be re-enrolled at Four Star Academy!

00:13:09.680 --> 00:13:11.560
We accept you with open arms.

00:13:11.560 --> 00:13:14.440
You did well to make your way back, Nanakura.

00:13:17.560 --> 00:13:19.310
Thank you very much!

00:13:19.310 --> 00:13:23.070
On the topic of enrollment, there is someone we would like to introduce.

00:13:24.530 --> 00:13:26.030
Alice-chan? {awwwwww shiiiit}{whoa}

00:13:26.030 --> 00:13:28.820
Bonjour! It has been a long time.

00:13:28.820 --> 00:13:30.580
That uniform...

00:13:30.580 --> 00:13:35.660
A certain person recommended her admission to Four Star Academy.

00:13:35.660 --> 00:13:38.460
I will be under your guidance.

00:13:38.460 --> 00:13:42.340
Come along, your welcome party is all but ready to begin!

00:13:42.340 --> 00:13:45.340
Let's go and raise the roof!

00:13:52.100 --> 00:13:54.480
Koharu-chan, you changed!

00:13:55.890 --> 00:13:57.100
Surprised?

00:13:57.100 --> 00:14:00.690
Now you're well and truly a student of Four Star.

00:14:00.690 --> 00:14:01.610
Yep!

00:14:01.610 --> 00:14:06.820
Attention! As the party is in full swing, it's time for the bouquet presentation!

00:14:10.530 --> 00:14:11.950
Koharu-chan... {lit me fam}

00:14:11.950 --> 00:14:13.870
Asahi-senpai?

00:14:13.870 --> 00:14:15.250
Koharu-chan...

00:14:16.040 --> 00:14:17.620
Koharu-chan!

00:14:17.620 --> 00:14:19.580
Welcome back!

00:14:22.710 --> 00:14:24.920
Koharu-chan!

00:14:24.920 --> 00:14:26.510
Here you are.

00:14:26.510 --> 00:14:28.380
Thank you!

00:14:28.380 --> 00:14:33.890
I'm sorry Hime and Tsubasa couldn't be here, but they had prior work.

00:14:33.890 --> 00:14:38.770
D-Don't be. I'm plenty honored that even you would come for this.

00:14:38.770 --> 00:14:41.480
Koharu...chan...

00:14:47.530 --> 00:14:49.530
Elza-sama...

00:14:49.530 --> 00:14:51.280
Have this if you'd like.

00:14:53.030 --> 00:14:55.040
Wh-Why?

00:14:56.290 --> 00:15:00.170
Back when Elza-sama expelled you...

00:15:00.580 --> 00:15:02.460
I said such mean things.

00:15:05.460 --> 00:15:07.710
What's past is past. {english stack exchange is useful sometimes}

00:15:07.710 --> 00:15:10.720
Moreover, now that I'm at this academy,

00:15:10.720 --> 00:15:14.850
I feel as though I will be able to discover a new radiance!

00:15:17.470 --> 00:15:22.350
"The pain of parting is nothing to the joy of meeting again."

00:15:22.350 --> 00:15:25.270
Or so said an English novelist. {Charles Dickens. 2/2, I'm proud of Lily}{wow, excellent}

00:15:25.270 --> 00:15:28.690
Really, I'm so glad you came back to us.

00:15:28.690 --> 00:15:29.570
Thank you.

00:15:29.570 --> 00:15:32.360
Lily-senpai, Juli-senpai.

00:15:32.360 --> 00:15:33.700
Juli?

00:15:34.160 --> 00:15:36.120
I mean, Yuri-senpai!

00:15:36.120 --> 00:15:38.620
Test, test. Attention!

00:15:38.950 --> 00:15:45.130
Now that the party has reached its peak, here's our shocking, astounding, surprise performance!{I'm not sure we need all these adjectives but fine}{blame cat}

00:15:45.130 --> 00:15:48.880
Nijino Yume and Sakuraba Rola!

00:15:49.340 --> 00:15:53.140
Watch us, Koharu-chan. We'll put on the best show you've ever seen!

00:15:53.140 --> 00:15:54.300
Okay!

00:16:01.190 --> 00:16:02.270
Yume?

00:16:02.270 --> 00:16:04.610
Rola, lend me your strength.

00:16:05.650 --> 00:16:09.360
I crashed and burned on stage at Koharu-chan's send-off event.

00:16:09.940 --> 00:16:12.860
I never want her to see something like that again.

00:16:14.240 --> 00:16:15.700
That's why, today...

00:16:15.700 --> 00:16:18.910
We'll put on the best show ever, right?

00:16:19.290 --> 00:16:23.580
You're a different person now. I know you can handle this.

00:16:23.580 --> 00:16:26.170
Besides, you've got me, too.

00:16:26.460 --> 00:16:27.920
Rola...

00:16:29.550 --> 00:16:30.960
Let's do this, Yume!

00:16:30.960 --> 00:16:32.220
Okay!

00:16:32.220 --> 00:16:33.840
Nijino Yume—

00:16:33.840 --> 00:16:35.590
Sakuraba Rola—

00:16:35.590 --> 00:16:38.470
It's our time to shine!

00:20:09.100 --> 00:20:11.600
Yume-chan, Rola, that was amazing!

00:20:11.600 --> 00:20:13.650
Yes, they're incredible.

00:20:13.650 --> 00:20:16.900
We can't afford to waste a single moment.

00:20:19.730 --> 00:20:23.570
That was a phenomenal performance, Yume-chan, Rola.

00:20:32.210 --> 00:20:37.880
I know it was Yuzu-senpai's request, but why do I have to be the one looking after her?

00:20:39.750 --> 00:20:42.260
Hey, that's my...

00:20:43.340 --> 00:20:47.140
Elza-sama, don't leave me...

00:20:49.060 --> 00:20:50.140
Goodness...

00:20:50.720 --> 00:20:52.770
I suppose I must.

00:20:59.690 --> 00:21:01.650
So you kept them with you.

00:21:01.650 --> 00:21:04.650
Of course. They're why I wasn't lonely.

00:21:04.650 --> 00:21:07.410
Still, it's good to be back.

00:21:11.160 --> 00:21:13.410
The night breeze feels so nice.

00:21:13.410 --> 00:21:18.420
Being here reminds me of when we first started school.

00:21:18.420 --> 00:21:21.590
Your dream was to get into S4.

00:21:22.170 --> 00:21:24.550
You made it come true, Yume-chan.

00:21:24.550 --> 00:21:25.760
Thanks.

00:21:26.640 --> 00:21:27.430
Still...

00:21:28.550 --> 00:21:32.310
Now that you're in S4, what's your new dream?

00:21:36.390 --> 00:21:37.560
My dream...

00:21:37.980 --> 00:21:39.650
...is to become the first star!

00:21:41.610 --> 00:21:45.570
The first-star idol shining brighter than anyone!

00:21:48.240 --> 00:21:51.950
Say, Yume-chan. Will you listen to what my dream is?

00:21:51.950 --> 00:21:53.450
What is it?

00:21:53.790 --> 00:21:58.830
To share the stage with you, the first-star idol, 
wearing a dress I designed.

00:21:59.670 --> 00:22:02.630
Your dream will definitely come true!

00:22:02.630 --> 00:22:05.170
No, we'll make it happen!

00:22:05.170 --> 00:22:09.680
Before that can happen, you'll need to be the first star.

00:22:09.680 --> 00:22:11.350
Oh, right.

00:22:15.850 --> 00:22:19.270
Don't worry. You'll definitely...

00:22:20.310 --> 00:22:22.020
...become the first star.

00:23:55.830 --> 00:23:58.450
We were able to show Koharu our best show ever!

00:23:58.450 --> 00:24:04.000
Yeah! And besides my dream of being the first-star, I made another precious dream.

00:24:04.000 --> 00:24:08.210
To take the stage with Koharu-chan wearing a dress she designed.

00:24:08.210 --> 00:24:10.010
May my wish come true!

00:24:10.920 --> 00:24:13.890
I need to work hard at both work and party preparations.

00:24:13.890 --> 00:24:17.180
Listen, there's something I need to tell you, Yume-chan.

00:24:17.180 --> 00:24:19.180
Next time on Aikatsu Stars!

00:24:19.180 --> 00:24:20.560
The two's first star. {or First-star of the two, hard to tell}

00:24:20.560 --> 00:24:23.100
Become the first-star idol!
